  "html": "<h1 id=\"지도학습의-두-가지-대표-task-classification과-regression\">지도학습의 두 가지 대표 Task: Classification과 Regression</h1>\n<p>지도학습(Supervised Learning)은 입력 데이터와 함께 정답(Label)을 제공하여 모델을 학습시키는 방법이다.</p>\n<p>지도학습에서 해결하는 대표적인 Task는 크게 두 가지로 나눌 수 있다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Classification</li>\n<li>Regression</li>\n</ol>\n<p>두 문제는 비슷한 신경망 구조를 사용할 수 있지만 <strong>무엇을 예측하는가</strong>에서 차이가 있다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"1-classification\">1. Classification</h1>\n<p><strong>분류(Classification)</strong>는 입력 데이터가 어떤 Class에 속하는지를 예측하는 문제이다.</p>\n<p>예를 들어</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Email\n→ Spam / Not Spam\n\nImage\n→ Dog / Cat\n\nTumor Data\n→ Benign / Malignant</code></pre>\n<p>과 같은 문제이다.</p>\n<p>결과가 특정 범주 중 하나로 결정되기 때문에 출력값은 이산적(Discrete)이다.</p>\n<hr>\n<div data-fuse=\"incontent_1_articlepage\" data-fuse-code=\"fuse-slot-incontent_1_articlepage-1\" data-fuse-zone-instance=\"zone-instance-incontent_1_articlepage-1\" data-fuse-slot=\"fuse-slot-incontent_1_articlepage-1\" data-gpid=\"/71161633,23323634633/VELOG_velog/incontent_1_articlepage#single-1\" data-fuse-processed-at=\"476\" class=\"fuse-slot-mini-scroller\" style=\"min-height: 250px;\"><div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_1-container\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\">\n      \n        <div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_1-scroll-clip\">\n          <div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_1 publift-widget-interscroller\"><div id=\"fuse-injected-articlepage_interscroller_1-1\" data-fuse=\"articlepage_interscroller_1\" data-fuse-injected-at=\"1793524875031\" class=\"fuse-slot-interscroller\" data-fuse-code=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_1-1\" data-fuse-zone-instance=\"zone-instance-articlepage_interscroller_1-1\" data-fuse-slot=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_1-1\" data-gpid=\"/71161633,23323634633/VELOG_velog/articlepage_interscroller_1#single-1\" data-fuse-processed-at=\"475\"><div id=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_1-1\" class=\"fuse-slot\" style=\"max-width: inherit; max-height: inherit;\"></div></div></div>\n        </div>\n    </div><div id=\"fuse-slot-incontent_1_articlepage-1\" class=\"fuse-slot\" style=\"max-width: inherit; max-height: inherit;\"></div></div><h2 id=\"binary-classification\">Binary Classification</h2>\n<p>Class가 두 개인 경우이다.</p>\n<p>예를 들어</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">0 → 정상\n1 → 불량</code></pre>\n<p>또는</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">0 → Spam 아님\n1 → Spam</code></pre>\n<p>과 같은 문제이다.</p>\n<p>이를 <strong>Binary Classification</strong>이라고 한다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"multiclass-classification\">Multiclass Classification</h2>\n<p>Class가 세 개 이상인 경우이다.</p>\n<p>예를 들어 Iris 데이터가</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Setosa\nVersicolor\nVirginica</code></pre>\n<p>세 가지 품종 중 하나를 예측하는 문제라면 Multiclass Classification이다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2-regression\">2. Regression</h1>\n<p><strong>회귀(Regression)</strong>는 연속적인 숫자 값을 예측하는 문제이다.</p>\n<p>예를 들어</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">House Data\n→ 450,000,000원\n\nSensor Data\n→ 3.27 V\n\nWeather Data\n→ 24.8 °C</code></pre>\n<p>과 같은 문제이다.</p>\n<p>결과가 특정 Class가 아니라 연속적인 실수값이다.</p>\n<hr>\n<div data-fuse=\"incontent_2_articlepage\" data-fuse-code=\"fuse-slot-incontent_2_articlepage-1\" data-fuse-zone-instance=\"zone-instance-incontent_2_articlepage-1\" data-fuse-slot=\"fuse-slot-incontent_2_articlepage-1\" data-gpid=\"/71161633,23323634633/VELOG_velog/incontent_2_articlepage#single-1\" data-fuse-processed-at=\"476\" class=\"fuse-slot-mini-scroller\" style=\"min-height: 250px;\"><div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_2-container\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\">\n      \n        <div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_2-scroll-clip\">\n          <div class=\"publift-widget-articlepage_interscroller_2 publift-widget-interscroller\"><div id=\"fuse-injected-articlepage_interscroller_2-1\" data-fuse=\"articlepage_interscroller_2\" data-fuse-injected-at=\"1793524875031\" class=\"fuse-slot-interscroller\" data-fuse-code=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_2-1\" data-fuse-zone-instance=\"zone-instance-articlepage_interscroller_2-1\" data-fuse-slot=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_2-1\" data-gpid=\"/71161633,23323634633/VELOG_velog/articlepage_interscroller_2#single-1\" data-fuse-processed-at=\"476\"><div id=\"fuse-slot-articlepage_interscroller_2-1\" class=\"fuse-slot\" style=\"max-width: inherit; max-height: inherit;\"></div></div></div>\n        </div>\n    </div><div id=\"fuse-slot-incontent_2_articlepage-1\" class=\"fuse-slot\" style=\"max-width: inherit; max-height: inherit;\"></div></div><h1 id=\"3-classification과-regression-비교\">3. Classification과 Regression 비교</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>구분</th><th>Classification</th><th>Regression</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>목적</td><td>Class 예측</td><td>연속적인 값 예측</td></tr><tr><td>출력</td><td>Discrete</td><td>Continuous</td></tr><tr><td>예</td><td>정상/불량</td><td>온도</td></tr><tr><td>예</td><td>개/고양이</td><td>전압</td></tr><tr><td>예</td><td>Spam/Not Spam</td><td>가격</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4-mlpclassifier\">4. MLPClassifier</h1>\n<p>scikit-learn에서는 MLP를 Classification에 사용할 수 있도록</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">sklearn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>neural_network<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>MLPClassifier</code></pre>\n<p>를 제공한다.</p>\n<p>예를 들어 Iris의 세 품종을 분류하고 싶다면 <code>MLPClassifier</code>를 사용할 수 있다.</p>\n<p>기본적인 구조는</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Input\n↓\nHidden Layer\n↓\nNon-linear Activation\n↓\nOutput\n↓\nClass Prediction</code></pre>\n<p>이다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"5-mlpregressor\">5. MLPRegressor</h1>\n<p>Regression 문제에서는</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">sklearn<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>neural_network<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>MLPRegressor</code></pre>\n<p>를 사용할 수 있다.</p>\n<p>예를 들어 Sensor 값으로부터 연속적인 전압을 예측한다면 결과는</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">3.21\n3.45\n2.98\n...</code></pre>\n<p>와 같은 숫자이다.</p>\n<p>Hidden Layer의 기본적인 구조는 MLPClassifier와 유사하지만 최종적으로 해결하려는 Task와 Output Layer의 동작 방식이 다르다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"6-같은-mlp인데-무엇이-다른가\">6. 같은 MLP인데 무엇이 다른가?</h1>\n<p>MLPClassifier와 MLPRegressor 모두 기본적으로</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Input\n↓\nLinear\n↓\nActivation\n↓\nLinear\n↓\nActivation\n↓\nOutput</code></pre>\n<p>과 같은 Feedforward Neural Network 구조를 사용할 수 있다.</p>\n<p>차이는 마지막에 원하는 결과이다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"classification\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Input</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Class</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Input} \\rightarrow \\text{Class}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8777699999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Class</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<h3 id=\"regression\">Regression</h3>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Input</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Continuous&nbsp;Value</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Input} \\rightarrow \\text{Continuous Value}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8777699999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Continuous&nbsp;Value</span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>따라서 문제의 Target이 무엇인지 먼저 확인해야 한다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"7-logistic-regression\">7. Logistic Regression</h1>\n<p>이름 때문에 혼동하기 쉬운 모델이 <strong>Logistic Regression</strong>이다.</p>\n<p>이름에는 Regression이 들어가지만 대표적인 <strong>Classification Algorithm</strong>이다.</p>\n<p>기본식은 먼저 Linear Combination을 계산한다.</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\mathbf{w}^T\\mathbf{x}+b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9746609999999999em;vertical-align:-0.08333em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">w</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913309999999999em\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>그리고 이를 Sigmoid Function에 통과시킨다.</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma(z) = \\frac{1}{1+e^{-z}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.09077em;vertical-align:-0.7693300000000001em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.32144em\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.697331em\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathdefault mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em\">z</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693300000000001em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>Sigmoid의 출력은 0과 1 사이에 존재한다.</p>\n<p>예를 들어</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.82</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma(z)=0.82</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>가 나왔다면 Class 1 쪽으로 높은 값을 출력한 것으로 해석할 수 있다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8-logistic-regression의-decision-boundary\">8. Logistic Regression의 Decision Boundary</h1>\n<p>Binary Classification에서 Threshold를 0.5로 사용한다고 생각해보자.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Probability &gt;= 0.5 → Class 1\nProbability &lt; 0.5  → Class 0</code></pre>\n<p>Sigmoid에서</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma(0)=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>이므로 Decision Boundary는</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{w}^T\\mathbf{x}+b=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9746609999999999em;vertical-align:-0.08333em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">w</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913309999999999em\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>과 연결된다.</p>\n<p>따라서 Logistic Regression 역시 기본적으로 Linear Decision Boundary를 사용하는 분류 모델이다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"9-perceptron과-logistic-regression\">9. Perceptron과 Logistic Regression</h1>\n<p>두 모델의 기본 구조는 비슷하게 볼 수 있다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"perceptron\">Perceptron</h3>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\mathbf{w}^T\\mathbf{x}+b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9746609999999999em;vertical-align:-0.08333em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">w</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913309999999999em\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">step</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y} = \\operatorname{step}(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.69444em\"><span style=\"top:-3em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em\">y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.19444em\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.19444em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">p</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>출력은 0 또는 1과 같이 바로 결정된다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"logistic-regression\">Logistic Regression</h3>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\mathbf{w}^T\\mathbf{x}+b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9746609999999999em;vertical-align:-0.08333em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.01597em\">w</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913309999999999em\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222222222222222em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y} = \\sigma(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.69444em\"><span style=\"top:-3em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em\">y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.19444em\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.19444em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2777777777777778em\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em\"></span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathdefault\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>0과 1 사이의 연속적인 값을 출력한다.</p>\n<p>즉 Linear Combination은 비슷하지만 마지막에 사용하는 함수와 학습 방식에 차이가 있다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"10-문제를-보고-모델을-고르는-기준\">10. 문제를 보고 모델을 고르는 기준</h1>\n<p>Target이 다음과 같다면 Classification 문제이다.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Dog / Cat\nNormal / Abnormal\nSpam / Not Spam\nA / B / C</code></pre>\n<p>반면 다음과 같다면 Regression 문제이다.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Temperature\nVoltage\nPrice\nDistance\nLifetime</code></pre>\n<p>따라서 모델을 선택하기 전에 가장 먼저 생각할 것은</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>내가 예측하려는 Target의 형태가 무엇인가?</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>이다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"핵심-정리\">핵심 정리</h2>\n<p>지도학습의 대표적인 두 Task는</p>\n<div class=\"math math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><menclose notation=\"box\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mtext>Classification</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mtext>vs</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace><mtext>Regression</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mstyle></mstyle></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boxed{ \\text{Classification} \\quad \\text{vs} \\quad \\text{Regression} }</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5688799999999998em;vertical-align:-0.53444em\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0344399999999998em\"><span style=\"top:-3.56888em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.56888em\"></span><span class=\"boxpad\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Classification</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vs</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Regression</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.03444em\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.56888em\"></span><span class=\"stretchy fbox\" style=\"height:1.5688799999999998em;border-style:solid;border-width:0.04em\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.53444em\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>이다.</p>\n<p>Classification은 <strong>어떤 Class인가</strong>를 예측하고,</p>\n<p>Regression은 <strong>값이 얼마인가</strong>를 예측한다.</p>\n<p>신경망 구조가 비슷하더라도 최종 출력의 형태와 학습 목적에 따라 모델의 성격이 달라진다.</p>",
